From: denfry <dabinayo@pm.me>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:07:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Check the version against Tessera releases

/version and the startup check compared a Tessera build number with
Folia's builds on the PaperMC downloads API, and a commit with the
PaperMC/Folia repository, which gave "Unknown version". Count the
GitHub releases of denfry/tessera for the same Minecraft version with a
higher build number, compare commits with denfry/tessera, link its
releases page and skip the Folia Minecraft version check.

